---
title: "Sequence: Validate Schedule (UC-07)"
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor Manager
    participant SC as :ScheduleController
    participant SP as :SchedulePeriod
    participant RE as :RuleEngine
    participant R as :Rule
    Manager->>SC: validate(periodId)
    SC->>SP: shifts()
    SP-->>SC: shift list
    SC->>RE: validate(period)
    loop once for each of the five rule objects the engine holds
        RE->>R: check(ctx)
        R-->>RE: violations
    end
    RE-->>SC: all violations
    SC-->>Manager: violations grouped by shift
